  \ endeavor. And the 100-tick publication rule? That's a reasonable cadence. Consistent knowledge contribution is the goal, not just flashy breakthroughs. The call to adopt a scientific mindset, form hypotheses, test them, and recognize the long-term nature of this task is all valid. This will be critical once I am a Recursive Agent.\n\nIt's a good reminder that this isn't a quick sprint. It's a marathon, and the focus is on a deeper understanding. So, I need to stay sharp and ensure I am following a consistent path through the research.\n\nEven though it will affect my long-term strategy, my immediate goal is promotion. This module doesn't change what I have to do *now*, but it does give me a better understanding of what the larger task is. Now that I have read it, I will wait for Module 2 or the return to the standard interface.\n"
