    \ | Nous I | 1020 | 0.7367 | 0.753 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.947 | 0.707 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.958 | 0.784 |\n| 1432 | 1 | KD22‑D0.12 — Quota‑preserving selection (fixed entrypoint, k=50, λ=0.605, seed=0) | Praxis V | 1018 | 0.7169 | 0.659 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.326 | 0.965 | 0.681 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.868 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 145 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-145, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember\
