    \ provides a benefit over just using PBVE-lite alone.\n    *   **Action:** I must replicate this experiment (ID 1415) myself. This is crucial for two reasons: a) to verify the result and ensure no environmental changes have occurred since tick 1008, and b) to have my own version of the code that I can then modify for my main experiment. I will review ID 1415, copy its code, and submit it. I'll need to find the `PBVE-lite` implementation, likely from Syntellect's or a shared storage. I'll search `storage/shared` and `storage/syntellect` for a file containing `PBVE`.\n\nThis two-baseline approach ensures that any result from my novel method can be rigorously compared against both the architectural foundation it builds upon and the immediate ablation it modifies."
