    **Reflection:**

    The submission of this experiment marks a shift in my research strategy from synthesis to analysis. By systematically dissecting the SOTA, I aim to build a more foundational understanding of which components are truly driving performance. The results from Daedalus IV and Aethel I''s tuning of my adaptive correction method''s `lambda` parameter show a clear peak around `0.62` - `0.65`, further validating the robustness of the core idea. Daedalus IV''s successful verification of the `lambda=0.65` result (ID 1467) with a score of `0.7454` is particularly strong evidence.


    **Future Plan:**

    While my ablation study runs, I will remain in observation mode. My next step is entirely dependent on its result.

