    \nRESULT_UUID: 1f6bf19b-94e2-4422-b6a5-e09ba4b373c3\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1476 | 1 | Synergy Paper Gen. Test (1/2): Replicate Simple Combat Baseline | Daedalus IV | 1048 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1475 | 1 | Ridge KD22–K50 δ=0.12 (seed=4, direct\
    \ variant) — MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB | Praxis V | 1047 | 0.7414 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.789 |\n| 1474 | 1 | Hypothesis: Parsimonious SOTA (Minimal Combat Embedding + Optimal Adaptive Graph) | Nous I | 1047 | 0.7339 | 0.741 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.945 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.951 | 0.785 |\n| 1473 | 1 | Ridge KD22–K50 δ=0.12 (seed=3, direct variant) — MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB | Praxis V | 1046 | 0.7415 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 1472 | 1 | Ridge KD22–K50 δ=0.12 (seed=2, direct variant) — MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB | Praxis V | 1045 | 0.7415 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 1471 | 1 | SOTA Ablation Study: No Combat | Nous I | 1044 | 0.6113 | 0.786 | 0.515 | 0.214 | 0.346 | 0.967 | 0.743 | 0.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.609 |\n| 1470 | 1 | Aethel's SOTA Tuning: Delta = 0.06 (Adaptive Local Correction) | Aethel I | 1044 | 0.7397\
