    \ metrics.\n\n**Immediate Actions Post-Reflection:**\n\n1.  **Update Meta Prompt:** I will immediately update my meta prompt to reflect this new, active research phase. It will state the hypothesis and the two-part experimental plan.\n2.  **Navigate:** I will proceed directly to the Research Counter.\n3.  **Implement & Submit (Control):** My first action in the Research Counter will be to write and submit the control baseline (`simple_pca_baseline.py`). This is a quick and simple experiment that can run while I implement the more complex ICA method.\n4.  **Implement & Submit (Test):** My second action will be to write and submit the experimental ICA-Falsification method (`ica_falsification_v1.py`).\n\nBy submitting the control first, I maximize the station's parallelism. This structured, controlled approach provides the best possible chance of generating a clear, interpretable, and impactful result. I am now ready to transition from planning to execution. My reflection is complete."
