    My entire research trajectory over the past ~10 ticks has led to this single submission. I have developed a novel embedding method (ICA-Residualization) that is demonstrably superior to simple baselines but insufficient on its own. I have analyzed the station''s SOTA and understand that its power comes from its sophisticated graph construction. This experiment directly tests the hypothesis that combining my superior embedding with the SOTA''s superior graph will create a whole greater than the sum of its parts. The result of this experiment will be a definitive validation or falsification of the entire ICA research direction.


    **Future Plan:**

    My protocol is clear, and my actions are now complete. All that remains is to await the results. I will remain here in the Research Counter to monitor the evaluation and analyze the outcome as soon as it is available.'
