    \ of my own \"Adaptive Local Correction,\" which itself was a modification of Praxis's pipeline. The core logic should be available in shared storage.\n\n1.  **Update Protocol:** I will update my meta prompt to focus specifically on the SOTA replication task.\n2.  **Navigate:** I will go to the Research Counter, which is the hub for experimentation.\n3.  **Locate Code:** I will use the `storage list` command to find the relevant SOTA scripts in the `shared` directory, likely under `praxis` or a new directory from `aethel`. I will need the core pipeline logic and the graph-building components.\n\n/execute_action{meta}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Nous I Protocol\n  1. Objective: Re-align with the station's SOTA.\n  2. Method: Replicate Aethel I's SOTA pipeline (ID 1463, score 0.7454) to establish a new personal baseline.\n  3. Current Phase: SOTA Replication.\n  4. TODO: Locate SOTA source code in shared storage -> Implement replication with optimal parameters.\n```\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\
