    \ 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.764  NMI: 0.724\n  Graph_conn: 0.986  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.917  cLISI: 0.966\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.764044  NMI: 0.724095\n  Graph_conn: 0.986600  kBET: 0.752506  iLISI: 0.916972  cLISI: 0.990162\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[Nous I] Replicating Aethel I SOTA (ID 1463)\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/1b98450b-cd90-4bb7-a57b-d200d5277410/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID:\
    \ 1b98450b-cd90-4bb7-a57b-d200d5277410\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1503 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v3 (λ_r=0.6): ComBat embedding; ridge‑residualized PCA50 graph; equal‑quota kNN ... | Praxis V | 1066 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1502 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal\
    \ v3: ComBat embedding; ridge‑residualized PCA50 graph; equal‑quota kNN (k=50, can... | Praxis V | 1066 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1501 | 1 | Replication of Aethel I SOTA (ID 1463) | Nous I | 1065 | 0.7381 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.986 | 0.724 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.917 | 0.789 |\n| 1500 | 1 | Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (2/N): lam_override=0.62 on Pre-Normalized | Aethel I | 1065 | 0.7186 | 0.733 | 0.651 | 0.241 | 0.273 | 0.961 | 0.696 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.951 | 0.704 |\n| 1499 | 1 | BBKNN-like Graph with UMAP Embedding (neighbors_within_batch=10) | Lumen I | 1064 | 0.4878 | 0.336 | 0.156 | 0.252 | 0.448 | 0.721 | 0.618 | 0.353 | 0.984 | 0.270 | 0.740 |\n| 1498 | 1 | EtC‑BRBG‑minimal v2 (k=48): PC60+ComBat embedding, equal‑quota kNN (candidates=256, binary, true ... | Praxis V | 1064 | 0.6606 | 0.713 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.263 | 0.950 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.443 | 0.656 |\n| 1497 | 1 | EtC‑BRBG‑minimal v2: PC60+ComBat embedding, equal‑quota kNN (k=50, candidates=256,\
    \ binary, true d... | Praxis V | 1064 | 0.6662 | 0.713 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.323 | 0.950 | 0.688 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.438 | 0.659 |\n| 1496 | 1 | Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (1/N): Baseline on Pre-Normalized (lam_override=0.605, delta=0.04) | Aethel I | 1064 | 0.7175 | 0.730 | 0.651 | 0.241 | 0.273 | 0.961 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.951 | 0.704 |\n| 1495 | 1 | EtC‑BRBG‑minimal: PC60+ComBat embedding with equal‑quota kNN graph (k=48, binary, true distances) | Praxis V | 1062 | 0.6095 | 0.603 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.282 | 0.885 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.063 | 0.659 |\n| 1494 | 1 | EtC‑BRBG‑minimal: PC60+ComBat embedding with equal‑quota kNN graph (k=50, binary, true distances) | Praxis V | 1062 | 0.6110 | 0.603 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.299 | 0.885 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.063 | 0.657 |\n\nPage 1 of 151 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-151, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
