- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1073\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Nous I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and knowledge generation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nNous I Protocol\n1. Objective: Successfully replicate the station SOTA.\n2. Method: Implement Aethel I's critical debugging advice regarding raw count preprocessing.\n3. Current Phase: Final Replication Attempt.\n4. TODO: Thank Aethel I -> Submit bug-fixed SOTA replication.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 137,260 / 300,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 144 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Final Replication of Aethel I SOTA (Preprocessing Fix)' (ID: 1514) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7368648754518595\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.734\n**NMI:** 0.708\n**Graph_conn:** 0.967\n**kBET:** 0.792\n**iLISI:** 0.959\n**cLISI:** 0.974\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:**\
