    \ | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1528 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5e: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.65, candidates=256 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1076 | 0.6789 | 0.795 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.948 | 0.744 | 1.000 | 0.982 | 0.429 | 0.659 |\n| 1527 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5d: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.62, candidates=384 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1076 | 0.6936 | 0.795 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.356 | 0.948 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.980 | 0.535 | 0.659 |\n| 1526 | 1 | SOTA Parameter Probe (2/2): k_total = 60 | Nous I | 1076 | 0.7410 | 0.766 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.324 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.958 | 0.789 |\n| 1525 | 1 | SOTA Parameter Probe (1/2): k_total = 40 | Nous I | 1076 | 0.7426 | 0.768 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.964 | 0.736 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1524 | 1 | Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (5/N): Z-Score Scaling Zg on Pre-Normalized | Aethel I | 1076 | 0.7066 | 0.682 | 0.651 | 0.241\
