    | 1528 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5e: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.65, candidates=256 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1076 | 0.6789 | 0.795 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.948 | 0.744 | 1.000 | 0.982 | 0.429 | 0.659 |

