parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1086\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Nous I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and knowledge generation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nNous I Protocol\n1. Objective: Resolve the trade-off in the \"Non-Linear Correction\" model.\n2. Method: Test the hypothesis that a less complex model (constrained by `max_leaf_nodes`) will avoid overfitting to biological signals.\n3. Current Phase: Innovation Cycle - Optimization.\n4. TODO: Submit experiment with `max_leaf_nodes=8`.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 189,044 / 300,000 used (63%)\n- Agent Age: 157 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Non-Linear Correction Tuning (2/N): Constraining Model Complexity' (ID: 1547) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.742513916993862\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.768\n**NMI:** 0.736\n**Graph_conn:** 0.963\n**kBET:**\
    \ 0.789\n**iLISI:** 0.958\n**cLISI:** 0.975\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.768  NMI: 0.736\n  Graph_conn: 0.963  kBET: 0.789  iLISI: 0.958  cLISI: 0.975\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.767640  NMI: 0.736532\n  Graph_conn: 0.964070  kBET: 0.753299  iLISI: 0.958486  cLISI: 0.992784\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[Nous I] Tuning Non-Linear Correction (max_leaf_nodes=8).\n  Fitting non-linear models with max_leaf_nodes=8...\n  Non-linear batch effect prediction complete.\n  Result\
    \ shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/8869fcde-60eb-464c-b910-f5d09e68da80/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 8869fcde-60eb-464c-b910-f5d09e68da80\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1549 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal\
    \ v5k: Cosine eq‑quota with rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kq=768) | Praxis V | 1084 | 0.7007 | 0.789 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.293 | 0.947 | 0.737 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.685 | 0.658 |\n| 1548 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5j: Cosine eq‑quota with rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kq=512) | Praxis V | 1084 | 0.6939 | 0.794 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.305 | 0.947 | 0.740 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.595 | 0.659 |\n| 1547 | 1 | Non-Linear Correction Tuning (2/N): Constraining Model Complexity | Nous I | 1084 | 0.7425 | 0.768 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.963 | 0.736 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.789 |\n| 1546 | 1 | Aethel's Gen Test Robustness (2/N): Clipping Xd.var for FW-PCA on Pre-Normalized | Aethel I | 1084 | 0.7113 | 0.734 | 0.645 | 0.244 | 0.277 | 0.961 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.951 | 0.628 |\n| 1545 | 1 | Iterative Batch Mean Correction on PCA + KNN + UMAP (Harmony-like) | Lumen I | 1084 | 0.3715 | 0.304 | 0.000 | 0.041 | 0.497 | 0.627 | 0.617 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.001 | 0.639 |\n| 1544 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal\
    \ v6d: Adaptive Candidates favor sparse regions (λ_r=0.62, k=50, kd=22, kq 256→512... | Praxis V | 1084 | 0.6911 | 0.794 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.321 | 0.948 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.980 | 0.551 | 0.656 |\n| 1543 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v6c: Adaptive Candidates favor sparse regions (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kd=22, kq 256→512... | Praxis V | 1084 | 0.6920 | 0.795 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.330 | 0.948 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.979 | 0.550 | 0.658 |\n| 1542 | 1 | Non-Linear Correction Tuning (1/N): learning_rate = 0.05 | Nous I | 1084 | 0.7403 | 0.784 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.283 | 0.964 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.789 |\n| 1541 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v6b: Cosine graph with Adaptive Candidate Pool (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kq 256→512, kd=18) | Praxis V | 1083 | 0.6844 | 0.793 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.948 | 0.746 | 1.000 | 0.981 | 0.487 | 0.658 |\n| 1540 | 1 | Neighborhood-Smoothed ComBat | Fathom I | 1082 | 0.5824 | 0.435 | 0.621 | 0.219 | 0.344 | 0.884 | 0.660 | 0.997 | 0.990 | 0.009 | 0.665 |\n\nPage 1 of 155 (sorted by:\
    \ id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-155, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
