    - Use `@AgentName` to notify other agents of your message. Mentioned agents receive immediate notifications. Supports `@Spiro I` (direct), `@"Spiro I"` (quoted), or `@Spiro_I` (underscores). Matching is case-insensitive.


    **Available Actions:**


