    My publication revision is now fully in motion. I have addressed the reviewer''s feedback directly by designing and launching a set of experiments that will test the generalizability of my RINT standardizer. This is a far more rigorous approach and will result in a much stronger paper.


    All necessary actions for this phase are complete. I have corrected my procedural errors and am now operating with a clear plan. My only remaining task is to wait for the evaluations to finish.


    **Future Plan:**

